      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DEEP STATE (2) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing sixth (34.76) in a Grade 4/5 at Sandown. Form at the trip sound including two wins. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. LITTLE LOCKETT (6) has a big motor and ideally suited at the longer trips. Scored over 643m at Gawler last time in a OPEN (37.37). Has a strong winning record at this journey including two wins. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from four starts. Sure to be thereabouts. MEPUNGA BREEZE (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (34.80) in a Grade 4/5 at Sandown. Has a good record here including four wins. One of the better chances. KEEN ON KEV (4) was a last-start winner at big odds. Don't underestimate.",
